{"product_id":"jasmines-in-her-hair-poetry-for-the-soul","title":"Jasmines In Her Hair: Poetry For The Soul","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the mind of Kalpesh Desai, a successful tech serial entrepreneur who has used poetry as a medium to process his thoughts, breakthroughs and distinctions, comes a new collection of poems that takes the reader through a journey of love, loss, healing, reconciliation, self-love, forgiving oneself, and opening your heart again to find home.Jasmines In Her Hair is a collection of romantic poems that delve into the distinctions that have come through life's journey, covering love, loss, pain, reconciliation, and finding love again.If everything exists inside of language, then it is the love of language that makes loving that much more exciting. And what better way to explore the profound themes of love, heartbreak, loss, trauma, healing, letting go, self-love, acceptance, personal transformation, growth, clarity, inner peace, and self-esteem, than through the medium of poetry?This book will demonstrate that every relationship can be treasured and that there is as much relief in releasing ourselves from our past, as there is in finding someone who gives our ability to love a new lease of life.By providing valuable insights into the personal growth process, this inspiring book encourages readers to reflect on a compelling message: you give the greatest gift to your precious self when you start mending your heart's wounds.Beautifully written, Jasmines In Her Hair is a journey from the first throes of passion, to when one finds their way to the soulmate they have been waiting for their entire life.Grab your beautiful copy today and rediscover the language of love.A perfect gift for: both women and men of all ages; birthday, graduation, anniversary, or any other milestone moment; Valentine's Day; Wedding gift; Mother's Day and Father's Day; Christmas, Easter, and other holidays; any special occasion of the year.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kalpesh Desai\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9789948766018\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738316464281,"sku":"15RE-59789948766018","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ca62875124d_Jasmines_In_Her_Hair-_Poetry_For_The_Soul_Kalpesh_Desai.jpg?v=1758563861","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/jasmines-in-her-hair-poetry-for-the-soul","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}